question-but\u2026?p=1520148#post1520148\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Same. It would depend entirely on what sort of game &amp;/or story I wished to run at the time. I mean, you wouldn\u2019t turn to Geist for the sort of political shenanigans &amp; chicanery that Changeling &amp; Vampire could offer, would you? At least, not without some major buggering.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sangiovanni would mix well with Geist, actually I had a chronicle idea about the Sangiovanni winning a conflict against a Mummy cult and deciding to bring them into the family rather than just looting their stuff. Wasn\u2019t sure if I could fit Geist into that one as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-09T20:01:21-07:00","id":1520257,"title":"","content":"I don't know that the Sangiovanni blend particularly well with Geist except maybe as antagonists, but the Eye of Gaede bloodline seems like they would.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-10T04:48:32-07:00","id":1520284,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m inclined to agree regarding serving as antagonist. Very much antagonist material.","sign